{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒い日が続きますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちも年末らしく､にそにそと忙しくしております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "忙殺とはよく言ったものだな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は、なんだか気付きたくないことを"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "忙しさを理由に目を瞑っているような、そんな感じ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このまんまだと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大事なことを見落としちゃいそうな気がするから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たしかめるみたいに今日はブログを書き始めています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/056/4a4f7097a4ff778df801b8cafa278.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/056/4a4f7097a4ff778df801b8cafa278-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/056/4a4f7097a4ff778df801b8cafa278-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/056/4a4f7097a4ff778df801b8cafa278-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し前に行ったの🍚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は舞台のお稽古をとても頑張っているあの子🩰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "年内には､絶対またご飯行くぞと息巻いています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて、もうすぐクリスマスですね〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "案外浮かれるほうです。意外でしょ😼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いや、そんな私のこともそろそろ君に知られてるかも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時期はイルミネーションなんかもいっぱいで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この間も例の4人で見たんだよ〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "光り輝くみんなの年貢💡😭😭✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それっぽい映画見ちゃおうかな〜🎄🎅🫎🎁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ毎年やってるので映画がかなりネタ切れしてきました😿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【求ム】クリスマスにおすすめの作品"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "27日のミーグリはクリスマスっけのある何かしらをしてみようかなあ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、ケーキとかも食べちゃおうかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ストレンジャーシングス（ガチ神）も見なきゃいけないんだ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type"